This repository vendors and derives from PolyBench/C 4.2.1:

- utilities/polybench.h and utilities/polybench.c are verbatim, unmodified
  copies of the corresponding files from PolyBench/C 4.2.1 (stamped
  May 10, 2016).
- The init_array and print_array function bodies embedded in the generated
  function_*_init.h sidecars are extracted verbatim from the PolyBench/C
  4.2.1 benchmark sources.
- The benchmark computations themselves are reimplementations of the
  PolyBench/C 4.2.1 kernels in the Tiramisu language, using PolyBench's
  dataset sizes, data types, and initialization semantics.

